:techniqueDFT-1054
    a owl:Class,
      solveit-core:Technique ;
    rdfs:label "DFT-1054: Review artifacts or content manually for relevant material"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf solveit-core:SolveitInvestigativeAction ;
    solveit-core:techniqueID "DFT-1054" ;
    solveit-core:techniqueName "Review artifacts or content manually for relevant material" ;
    solveit-core:techniqueDescription "Manual examination of files or artifacts to determine their relevance to the investigation." ;
    solveit-core:techniqueDetails """The result of this process is a classification, which may be 'relevant', or could be more specific, e.g. 'contains reference to x'. This technique is likely paired with T1091 (Bookmark artifacts) but they could be recorded in other ways. 

This manual review could be for:
- images (DFT-1081) 
- video (DFT-1080)
- audio (DFT-1079)
- the general content of files (DFT-1058)
- artefacts in general.""" ;
    solveit-core:hasCASEInputClass solveit-observable:ArtifactSet,
                                   solveit-observable:FileSet ;
    solveit-core:hasCASEOutputClass <https://ontology.unifiedcyberontology.org/uco/analysis/ArtifactClassification>,
                                    solveit-observable:ArtifactSet,
                                    solveit-observable:FileSet ;
    solveit-core:hasPotentialWeakness :weaknessDFW-1060,
                                      :weaknessDFW-1061,
                                      :weaknessDFW-1062 .

