:mitigationDFM-1231
    a solveit-core:Mitigation ;
    rdfs:label "DFM-1231: Make use of 'paired searching'"@en ;
    solveit-core:mitigationID "DFM-1231" ;
    solveit-core:mitigationName "Make use of 'paired searching'" ;
    solveit-core:mitigationDescription "According to Fisher & Fisher (2012): \"Indoor crime scene searches are best done with two persons. One easy way of accomplishing a search in a room is to divide it in half. Each investigator searches one half. After they have done a thorough search, they switch halves.\" " ;
    solveit-core:hasReference :citationDFCite-1043 .

