    solveit-core:mitigationDescription "According to Fisher & Fisher (2012): \"Criminal investigation texts recommend a variety of search patterns: the strip or lane search, grid search, spiral search, and quadrant search. \" " ;
    solveit-core:hasReference :citationDFCite-1043 .

