    solveit-core:mitigationID "DFM-1365" ;
    solveit-core:mitigationName "Check the number of bytes hashed from a source device matches the device's capacity" ;
    solveit-core:mitigationDescription "Compare the number of bytes (or sectors) read and hashed against the capacity on the drive label or reported by the device. A shortfall indicates that the hash covers only part of the data on the device." .

